<!--tz-meta {"id":"ex-cta","title":"CTA — Big Top Bill","category":"Elixir","file":"elixir/cta.heex","tags":["heex","phoenix","cta","poster","vintage"],"description":"A 1910 big-top bill for Latch: one-week-only starburst seal, wood-type Rye headline, a single red ticket-button.","dnas":["circus-poster"]} -->
<%!-- def cta(assigns) — attr :seal_text, :string, default: "ONE WEEK ONLY" · attr :headline, :string · attr :sub, :string · attr :cta_label, :string · attr :cta_href, :string --%>
<%!--
Design read: A 1910 big-top bill pasted on a brick wall — a starburst seal screaming the offer, wood-type Rye headline, one red ticket-button with a perforated edge. Loud, but disciplined.
Distinctive choice: the rotating starburst seal behind the seal text — the only thing on the page allowed to spin, and it stops if you ask it to.
Dials: VARIANCE 7 / MOTION 3 / DENSITY 2. DNA: circus-poster (Rye / Bitter / Space Mono).
--%>
<style>
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rye&family=Bitter:wght@400;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap");
.tz-bill {
  --tz-bg: #f5e8c8;
  --tz-ink: #2b1408;
  --tz-muted: #8a6b45;
  --tz-accent: #b3202c;
  --tz-line: #2b140829;
  --tz-font-display: "Rye", "Georgia", serif;
  --tz-font-body: "Bitter", "Georgia", serif;
  --tz-font-mono: "Space Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
  background: var(--tz-bg);
  color: var(--tz-ink);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-body);
  padding: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 9rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 4px double var(--tz-ink);
  border-bottom: 4px double var(--tz-ink);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.tz-bill__inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; }
.tz-bill__seal {
  width: 148px;
  height: 148px;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  position: relative;
  animation: tz-bill-wobble 9s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes tz-bill-wobble {
  0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-6deg); }
  50% { transform: rotate(6deg); }
}
.tz-bill__seal svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
.tz-bill__seal-text {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--tz-bg);
  padding: 0 2.1rem;
}
.tz-bill__rule {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.28em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--tz-accent);
}
.tz-bill__rule::before, .tz-bill__rule::after {
  content: "";
  height: 2px;
  width: clamp(40px, 10vw, 110px);
  background: var(--tz-accent);
}
.tz-bill__headline {
  font-family: var(--tz-font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5.2rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  text-wrap: balance;
}
.tz-bill__sub {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  max-width: 52ch;
  margin: 0 auto 2.75rem;
  color: var(--tz-ink);
}
.tz-bill__ticket {
  display: inline-block;
  position: relative;
  background: var(--tz-accent);
  color: var(--tz-bg);
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-decoration: none;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 1.15rem 3rem;
  transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}
.tz-bill__ticket::before, .tz-bill__ticket::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 6px;
  bottom: 6px;
  width: 12px;
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, var(--tz-bg) 3.2px, transparent 3.4px);
  background-size: 12px 14px;
  background-repeat: repeat-y;
}
.tz-bill__ticket::before { left: 8px; }
.tz-bill__ticket::after { right: 8px; }
.tz-bill__ticket:hover { transform: scale(1.04) rotate(-1deg); }
.tz-bill__fine {
  margin-top: 1.75rem;
  font-family: var(--tz-font-mono);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--tz-muted);
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .tz-bill__seal { animation: none; }
  .tz-bill__ticket { transition: none; }
}
</style>
<section class="tz-bill" aria-label="Get started">
  <div class="tz-bill__inner">
    <div class="tz-bill__seal" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">
        <polygon
          fill="#b3202c"
          points="50,0 58,8 68,3 71,13 82,12 81,23 92,26 87,35 97,41 89,48 97,56 87,61 91,71 80,72 79,83 69,79 64,89 55,82 47,90 41,81 31,84 29,73 18,73 20,62 9,58 15,50 7,43 17,38 14,27 25,27 27,16 37,19 41,9"
        />
      </svg>
      <span class="tz-bill__seal-text">{@seal_text}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="tz-bill__rule">Step right up</p>
    <h2 class="tz-bill__headline">{@headline}</h2>
    <p class="tz-bill__sub">{@sub}</p>
    <.link href={@cta_href} class="tz-bill__ticket">{@cta_label}</.link>
    <p class="tz-bill__fine">No card required · keep your invoices either way · hecklers welcome</p>
  </div>
</section>
